VALUES (4034, 'tt0058203', NULL, 'That Man from Rio', 'L''Homme de Rio', 'movie', 1964, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AhaUqqHTIMSXG6WOMRCreitQ1ZX.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1oziVuVtJc7BgHRCVLhVJ53u9u3.jpg', 'French military man Adrien Dufourquet gets an eight-day furlough to visit his fiancée, Agnès. But when he arrives in Paris, he learns that her late father''s partner, museum curator Professor Catalan, has just been kidnapped by a group of Amazon tribesmen who have also stolen a priceless statue from the museum. Adrien and Agnès pursue the kidnappers to Brazil, where they learn that the statue is the key to a hidden Amazon treasure.', NULL, NULL, 3.0674, 7.3, 0, 10.51, '2026-10-31 20:20:27', '2026-10-31 20:20:27')
