VALUES (524216, 'tt7781432', NULL, 'The Mortuary Collection', 'The Mortuary Collection', 'movie', 2020, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5WXeYnezavNI6hXH74aQYv6yFzj.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tsGSTBl5H8DBLnHc24Teny0Ppc5.jpg', 'In the phantasmagorical town of Raven''s End, a misguided young girl takes refuge in a decrepit old mortuary. The eccentric undertaker chronicles the strange history of the town through a series of twisted tales, each more terrifying than the last, but the young girl''s world is unhinged when she discovers that the final story... is her own.', NULL, NULL, 3.7956, 6.7, 0, 10.51, '2026-10-31 20:20:27', '2026-10-31 20:20:27')
