VALUES (38405, 'tt0100991', NULL, 'Hiruko the Goblin', 'ヒルコ／妖怪ハンター', 'movie', 1991, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6LKKFG3vVq1isjKMnBejwybErf1.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vsDS55XwnRveHp4jgCHQ75LJzlp.jpg', 'A school was built on one of the Gates of Hell, behind which hordes of demons await the moment they will be free to roam the Earth. Hiruko is a goblin sent to Earth on a reconnaissance mission. He beheads students in order to assemble their heads on the demons'' spider-like bodies. Hieda, an archaeology professor, and Masao, a haunted student, investigate the gory deaths.', NULL, NULL, 2.0203, 6.303, 0, 10.11, '2026-10-31 20:20:27', '2026-10-31 20:20:27')
